# Accuracy src evidence · `guide:accuracy:src-evidence`

**Rule (Exact bound identities)** · `rule:accuracy:bound-identities`

The nonnegative wrapper preserves exact zero for neutral bound composition and exact unity for neutral scaling; wrapping these finite identities introduces no rounding error and grants no physical assurance.

